よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/gallery/tink-posts-K6puGcw", "nc": 185, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@5KW1m7t8UM/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "comic", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3929313, "client_id": 8427, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8da715ba/uploads/origins/14971903-c701-47ad-8590-1493007562b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69d44837f54d138d966b106731076e25", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8da715ba/uploads/origins/14971903-c701-47ad-8590-1493007562b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69d44837f54d138d966b106731076e25, https://si.imgix.net/8da715ba/uploads/origins/14971903-c701-47ad-8590-1493007562b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa86a5159aa74bc6ce16a2e2a4dae12a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8da715ba/uploads/origins/14971903-c701-47ad-8590-1493007562b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6beef922e7b700482ac1f16025045fd 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8da715ba/uploads/origins/14971903-c701-47ad-8590-1493007562b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f8e441c77b4451041a9d79f254617808", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8da715ba/uploads/origins/14971903-c701-47ad-8590-1493007562b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f8e441c77b4451041a9d79f254617808, https://si.imgix.net/8da715ba/uploads/origins/14971903-c701-47ad-8590-1493007562b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed82b1c38bcb58a772c86a9308230512 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8da715ba/uploads/origins/14971903-c701-47ad-8590-1493007562b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a642786ec027bca7500dfaf08698885c 3x"}, "body": "Runoba海屋先生に書いていただきたい漫画があり、再度リクエストを送らせていただきました\n\n書いていただきたいのは白黒の短めの漫画で登場人物は中1のちょっと目付きが悪くて不良っぽい背が低めの男の子と、その子の幼馴染のその子より少し背が高い可愛い顔立ちの男の子で\n\n不良っぽい男の子が花粉症でマスクして鼻をムズムズ、目をウルウルさせていて、それを見たかわいい男の子が「マスクに潤んだ目元、おまえがそうなってると春になったって感じがするな～」と言って、不良っぽい子が「人の地獄をフーブツシみたいに言うな」と少し怒って、可愛い顔立ちの子が「ごめんごめん」と謝りながら心の中で「かわいいな～」と思ってるみたいな内容でお願いします\n\n再度のリクエストで申し訳ありません。\nよろしければご検討のほどよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 3031, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "漬物", "screen_name": "oh_takuan", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2039012217287512064/yVsDMLID.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/4901554117/1750074537/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {"id": 600840, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "Do-luck", "screen_name": "Doluck8", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1909301426322653186/nWkbseEm.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1186846735877828608/1664404487/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {"id": 2151989, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ゼロナナ", "screen_name": "z0w07", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1507678173353627648/gJwF5DAe.jpg", "header_url": "https:/